<title>HUNGARY: IEB 1996 PRE-TAX PROFIT HUF 2.09 BLN.</title>
<headline>IEB 1996 PRE-TAX PROFIT HUF 2.09 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary annual results for</p>
<p>1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Jan-Dec 1996    Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    2,086.6	vs    1,783.4</p>
<p>    Net interest income	     3,251.3	vs    3,771.9</p>
<p>	Interest received	    15,224.6	vs   11,138.9</p>
<p>	Interest paid		  11,973.3	vs    7,366.9</p>
<p>    Dividend received		    23.8	vs	 14.0</p>
<p>    Other operating revenue	 2,803.4	vs    1,550.2</p>
<p>    Other revenue			 180.0	vs	 72.6</p>
<p>    Other operating expend.	   384.9	vs	539.7</p>
<p>    Other expenditure		 1,301.8	vs    1,209.8</p>
<p>    Risk provisions		     547.5	vs	672.7</p>
<p>    Other provisions		    174.7	vs	145.2</p>
<p>    Operating costs		   2,427.1	vs    1,895.6</p>
<p>    Net operating income	    2,144.7	vs    1,763.7</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	   58.1 loss vs  17.9 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Inter-Europa Bank is a commercial bank, member of</p>
<p>Italy's Bancario San Paolo .</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
